From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothe <timothe.renou@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Sparrow perf: explosion ray step configurable

Optimise le calcul de la sphere d explosion dans Explosion.a() :

  explosion.rayStep (SparrowPerfConfig) controle le pas d echantillonnage
  des rayons de la sphere 16x16x16.

  Valeurs :
    1 = vanilla (1352 rayons par explosion, defaut)
    2 = ~296 rayons (~78% de reduction, recommande pour factions)
    3 = ~150 rayons (~89% de reduction, legere imprecision sur les bords)

  La condition de surface est adaptee :
    k + step > 15  (au lieu de k == 15)
  pour couvrir correctement la face distale quel que soit le step.

Gains attendus avec rayStep=2 lors de cannons actifs :
   -70 a -80% CPU imputable aux explosions.
   Sur serveur idle : aucun impact (pas d explosions = rien a calculer).
   Indetectable en jeu pour le joueur moyen (dommages aux blocs en bordure
   de sphere inchanges sur le coeur ; legere imprecision aux bords extremes).

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/Explosion.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/Explosion.java
index e605298073e4911c746d06465d09d6cae0a63f6c..451f74a9581f60eb208c89562b54ed7aa0c05013 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/Explosion.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/Explosion.java
@@ -72,10 +72,11 @@ public class Explosion {
         Block block = world.getChunkAt((int) posX >> 4, (int) posZ >> 4).getBlockData(new BlockPosition(posX, posY, posZ)).getBlock(); // PandaSpigot - get block of the explosion
 
         if (!this.world.pandaSpigotConfig.optimizeLiquidExplosions || !block.getMaterial().isLiquid()) { // PandaSpigot - skip calculating what blocks to blow up in water/lava
-        for (int k = 0; k < 16; ++k) {
-            for (i = 0; i < 16; ++i) {
-                for (j = 0; j < 16; ++j) {
-                    if (k == 0 || k == 15 || i == 0 || i == 15 || j == 0 || j == 15) {
+        int sparrowRayStep = com.hpfxd.pandaspigot.config.SparrowPerfConfig.explosionRayStep; // SparrowPerf
+        for (int k = 0; k < 16; k += sparrowRayStep) {
+            for (i = 0; i < 16; i += sparrowRayStep) {
+                for (j = 0; j < 16; j += sparrowRayStep) {
+                    if (k == 0 || k + sparrowRayStep > 15 || i == 0 || i + sparrowRayStep > 15 || j == 0 || j + sparrowRayStep > 15) { // SparrowPerf
                         double d0 = (double) ((float) k / 15.0F * 2.0F - 1.0F);
                         double d1 = (double) ((float) i / 15.0F * 2.0F - 1.0F);
                         double d2 = (double) ((float) j / 15.0F * 2.0F - 1.0F);
